<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Cribl.Cloud Platform on Cribl Python SDK</title><link>https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/v1/docs/guides/examples/cloud-platform/</link><description>Recent content in Cribl.Cloud Platform on Cribl Python SDK</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/v1/docs/guides/examples/cloud-platform/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Create a Cribl.Cloud API Credential (Organization Admin)</title><link>https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/v1/docs/guides/examples/cloud-platform/cloud-api-credential-organization-admin/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/v1/docs/guides/examples/cloud-platform/cloud-api-credential-organization-admin/</guid><description>&lt;nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"&gt;&lt;a href="../../../"&gt;Guides&lt;/a&gt; › &lt;a href="../../"&gt;Examples&lt;/a&gt; › &lt;a href="../"&gt;Cribl.Cloud Platform&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/nav&gt;
&lt;h1 id="create-a-criblcloud-api-credential-organization-admin"&gt;Create a Cribl.Cloud API Credential (Organization Admin)&lt;a class="anchor" href="#create-a-criblcloud-api-credential-organization-admin"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p class="example-meta"&gt;&lt;span class="badge"&gt;Cribl.Cloud&lt;/span&gt; &lt;code&gt;example_cloud_api_credential_organization_admin.py&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Creates a new API Credential with the Admin role on the Organization. That role
applies across the Organization, including all Workspaces and products (no
Workspace or product matrix is required).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The create response includes clientSecret once. Do not print or log it. Store it
securely if you will use the new credential later.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://docs.cribl.io/cribl-as-code/sdks-auth/#sdks-auth-cloud"&gt;https://docs.cribl.io/cribl-as-code/sdks-auth/#sdks-auth-cloud&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote class='book-hint note'&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This example is for Cribl.Cloud only (&lt;code&gt;cribl.cloud.api_credentials&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Create a Cribl.Cloud API Credential (Organization/Workspace User, Product Editor)</title><link>https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/v1/docs/guides/examples/cloud-platform/cloud-api-credential-workspace-product-roles/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/v1/docs/guides/examples/cloud-platform/cloud-api-credential-workspace-product-roles/</guid><description>&lt;nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"&gt;&lt;a href="../../../"&gt;Guides&lt;/a&gt; › &lt;a href="../../"&gt;Examples&lt;/a&gt; › &lt;a href="../"&gt;Cribl.Cloud Platform&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/nav&gt;
&lt;h1 id="create-a-criblcloud-api-credential-organizationworkspace-user-product-editor"&gt;Create a Cribl.Cloud API Credential (Organization/Workspace User, Product Editor)&lt;a class="anchor" href="#create-a-criblcloud-api-credential-organizationworkspace-user-product-editor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p class="example-meta"&gt;&lt;span class="badge"&gt;Cribl.Cloud&lt;/span&gt; &lt;code&gt;example_cloud_api_credential_workspace_product_roles.py&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Creates a new API Credential with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;User role on the Organization and the &lt;code&gt;main&lt;/code&gt; Workspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Editor on all Cribl products in the &lt;code&gt;main&lt;/code&gt; Workspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An optional IP allowlist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The create response includes clientSecret once. Do not print or log it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://docs.cribl.io/cribl-as-code/sdks-auth/#sdks-auth-cloud"&gt;https://docs.cribl.io/cribl-as-code/sdks-auth/#sdks-auth-cloud&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote class='book-hint note'&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This example is for Cribl.Cloud only (&lt;code&gt;cribl.cloud.api_credentials&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2 id="prerequisites"&gt;Prerequisites&lt;a class="anchor" href="#prerequisites"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;pip install cribl-python-sdk&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CRIBL_CLIENT_ID, CRIBL_CLIENT_SECRET (an existing API Credential, to authenticate)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CRIBL_ORGANIZATION_ID&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CRIBL_CLOUD_URL (workspace origin; still required by the client constructor)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id="environment-variables"&gt;Environment variables&lt;a class="anchor" href="#environment-variables"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
	&lt;thead&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Variable&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Default&lt;/th&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/thead&gt;
	&lt;tbody&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;CRIBL_CLIENT_ID&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;your-client-id&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;CRIBL_CLIENT_SECRET&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;your-client-secret&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;CRIBL_ORGANIZATION_ID&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;your-org-id&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;CRIBL_CLOUD_URL&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;https://main-your-org.cribl.cloud&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
