&lt;h1 id="criblcloud-billing-example"&gt;Cribl.Cloud billing example&lt;a class="anchor" href="#criblcloud-billing-example"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p class="example-meta"&gt;&lt;span class="badge"&gt;Cribl.Cloud&lt;/span&gt; &lt;code&gt;example_cloud_billing.py&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prints the Organization&amp;rsquo;s credit balance and lists its credit grants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To get Client ID and Secret:
&lt;a href="https://docs.cribl.io/cribl-as-code/sdks-auth/#sdks-auth-cloud"&gt;https://docs.cribl.io/cribl-as-code/sdks-auth/#sdks-auth-cloud&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote class='book-hint note'&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This example is for Cribl.Cloud only. It calls &lt;code&gt;cribl.cloud.billing.*&lt;/code&gt; (gateway),
not the control-plane &lt;code&gt;/api/v1&lt;/code&gt; APIs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2 id="prerequisites"&gt;Prerequisites&lt;a class="anchor" href="#prerequisites"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;pip install cribl-python-sdk&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CRIBL_CLIENT_ID, CRIBL_CLIENT_SECRET&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CRIBL_ORGANIZATION_ID&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CRIBL_CLOUD_URL (workspace origin; still required by the client constructor)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
